  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Canvas and Leather Travel Kit is a sleek, vintage-styled toiletry bag inspired by the classic dopp bag issued to military personnel. Crafted from naturally water-resistant cotton canvas and accented with sophisticated leather trim, this compact travel kit is perfect for organizing your essentials. The canvas dopp bag features a glossy brass zipper for reliable closure and snap buttons on each side to adjust the size for storing additional travel items.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
