  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Canvas and Leather Travel Kit is a sleek, vintage-styled toiletry bag inspired by the classic dopp bag issued to military personnel. Crafted from naturally water-resistant cotton canvas and accented with sophisticated leather trim, this compact travel kit is perfect for organizing your essentials. The canvas dopp bag features a glossy brass zipper for reliable closure and snap buttons on each side to adjust the size for storing additional travel items. Measuring 9.5 inch x 4 inch x 5.5 inch, the vintage toiletry bag fits easily into your duffle bag or luggage, making it an ideal travel companion. Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of ultra-premium canvas bags and packs.</p>",
